1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:42,251
Mira: What are you eating to be so skinny? There's so much delicious food in Vietnam and you don't eat it?

2
00:00:42,301 --> 00:02:06,804
Michael: I'm on a diet to lose weight. Don't you see that we Americans are usually fat? I want to live more khỏe mạnh.

3
00:02:06,854 --> 00:07:02,617
Mira: What kind of diet makes you look so weak? We Russians believe that men should be khỏe mạnh, must ăn a lot of meat. You need to ăn more!

4
00:07:02,667 --> 00:14:47,438
Michael: Being khỏe mạnh doesn't mean you have to ăn a lot of meat. I ăn plenty of vegetables and tập exercise every day. Would you like to tập gym with me?

5
00:14:47,488 --> 00:19:00,999
Mira: Tập gym? No way! Chess is the best way to keep the mind khỏe mạnh. But... if you want to be truly khỏe mạnh, I could cook you a traditional Russian borscht...

